{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ramp trip reserve and alternate fuel ramp trip reserve and alternate fuel","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","fileName":"Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 21:32\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Aircraft Airworthiness and Resource Planning]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Aircraft Airworthiness and Resource Planning","flightscience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ramp trip reserve and alternate fuel ramp trip reserve and alternate fuel","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","fileName":"Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel","heading":"Ramp, Trip, Reserve, and Alternate Fuel","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Ramp fuel covers all fuel onboard before departure, including start, taxi, takeoff, trip, and planned reserves. Contingency fuel addresses variation in route or consumption, alternate fuel supports a diversion or missed approach, final reserve protects the last safe endurance margin, and extra fuel covers special circumstances. The categories prevent one undifferentiated total from hiding why each portion is required.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Aircraft Airworthiness and Resource Planning","flightscience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart